        hypothesis='A depth (8-used_MAP) posterior-optimal tree with all-baseline-branch admissibility reduces total actual membership calls by at least 2% versus the original H3br comparator of 10355 on all4096 unchanged archived cases. Sole scientific endpoint: 100*new_calls <= 98*10355, passing maximum10147. H3bu and H3bv remain incomplete at their original state caps; neither prefix is resumed or reused for free. Every actual label across all4096 cases is reacquired. H3bt saving64calls remains below its2% target; prior studies are descriptive.',
