        counterfactual='Record all candidate remaining query counts AND exact flags. Singleton cost0 exactTrue. A terminal feasible original-depth4 tree contributes its leaf depths exactTrue. A terminal infeasible tree contributes0 additional actual membership calls exactFalse; this is expected inadmissibility, not an exception, excluded branch, or changed original baseline. Both predicted MAP-label branches remain in the full dependency graph. Root receipts are bound before actual routing. Counterfactual model computations make zero actual oracle invocations.',
