        correctness='Every actual exact flag must equal its original H3br flag:4083 exact and13 failures. Any accepted handoff is feasible and proves every original-baseline candidate branch exact; absent handoff the original MAP prefix and terminaldepth4 decision are retained. Sets above16 are ineligible; atMAP4 they cannot fit a depth4 binary tree. Restricted-tree checks use the recorded requested handoffdepth, without incorrectly asserting a deeper tree gives depth4 separability. See GUARD_LEMMA.md.',
